(kinematic-bridge-lagged-attitude)
*title Generic 3+3 DOF prescribed-attitude bridge
*mode kinematic-6dof
*atmos none
*earth spherical gm=0 omega=0
*runtime status attitude mode=lag roll-deg=0 pitch-deg=4 yaw-deg=30 lag-s=0.5 max-rate-deg-s=180

*trajectory 1 bridge-vehicle start on 1
  *initial ecic x=7000000 y=0 z=0 xdt=0 ydt=100 zdt=0 time=0 mass=1
  *segment 1 prescribed-attitude
    *integ dtprnt=0.1 dt=0.1
    *when time>10.0 stop
*end
